Let  $m$  and  $n$  denote integers greater than  $1$ , and let  $
u (n)$  be the number of primes less than or equal to  $n$ . Show that if the equation  $ rac{n}{
u(n)}=m$  has a solution, then so does the equation  $ rac{n}{
u(n)}=m-1$ .

For any positive integer  $n$ , we define the function  $f(n)$  as   $$ f(n)=\left\{\begin{aligned}
&n^{100} &&&& \text{if the sum of the digits of}~n~\text{is even}  
&-n^{100} &&&& \text{if the sum of the digits of}~n~\text{is odd} 
\end{aligned}\right. $$  Suppose  $S=f(1)+f(2)+\ldots+f(10^{100}-1)$ . Find the largest non-negative integer  $m$ , such that  $5^m\mid S$ .

The sequence  $(\chi_n) _{n=1}^{\infty}$  is defined as follows
\begin{align*} \chi_{n+1}=\chi_n  + \chi _{\lceil \frac{n}{2} \rceil} ~, \chi_1 =1 \end{align*}
Prove that none of the terms of this sequence are divisible by  $4$

For any positive integer  $x$ , we set  $$   g(x) = \text{ largest odd divisor of } x, $$    $$   f(x) = \begin{cases}
    \frac{x}{2} + \frac{x}{g(x)} & \text{ if } x \text{ is even;} 
    2^{\frac{x+1}{2}} & \text{ if } x \text{ is odd.}
  \end{cases} $$  Consider the sequence  $(x_n)_{n \in \mathbb{N}}$  defined by  $x_1 = 1$ ,  $x_{n + 1} = f(x_n)$ . Show that the integer  $2018$  appears in this sequence, determine the least integer  $n$  such that  $x_n = 2018$ , and determine whether  $n$  is unique or not.

Consider a cone of revolution with an inscribed sphere tangent to the base of the cone. A cylinder is circumscribed about this sphere so that one of its bases lies in the base of the cone. let  $V_1$  be the volume of the cone and  $V_2$  be the volume of the cylinder.

a) Prove that  $V_1 \neq V_2$ ;

b) Find the smallest number  $k$  for which  $V_1=kV_2$ ; for this case, construct the angle subtended by a diamter of the base of the cone at the vertex of the cone.

Find the number of triples  $(a, b, c)$  of positive integers such that
(a)  $a b$  is a prime;
(b)  $b c$  is a product of two primes;
(c)  $a b c$  is not divisible by square of any prime and
(d)  $a b c \leq 30$ .
